  "updated_at": "2026-03-02",
  "bio": "Carlos Torres, based in Portland, United States, is a highly skilled tattoo artist known for his exceptional work in floral and sketch styles, with a particular specialty in black and grey realism and dot work. His professionalism is evident not just in the stunning detail of his tattoos but also in his diverse talent, which extends to paintings and drawings. Carlos creates captivating body art at Flesh Electric Tattoo, where clients can also commission unique pieces that reflect his distinct artistic vision."
